values the initiative of Neak Oknha Dr. Pung Kheav Se for founding CamTech University to respond to Cambodia\u2019s socio-economic development, Science, Technology, and Innovation Roadmap 2030, and Vision 2050. Cambodia has seen remarkable economic development in the past few decades, but Science, technology, and innovation will ensure higher productivity and regional competitiveness of our country. Neak Oknha Dr. Pung Kheav Se responds in this speech that, \u201cthe sponsorship model of CamTech will provide opportunities for students to get quality education while ensuring internship experience and linkage between CamTech and industry partners.\u201d Readmore Quality of higher education largely depends on innovative ideas, research-informed teaching methods, quality of research in generating new knowledge, continuous cooperation between education institutions and entrepreneurs, and expanding community services. The MoU between NISTI and CamTech will help Cambodian students to develop values and become well-rounded citizens. Well-rounded citizens with values possess virtues, innovative ideas and skills in research, problem-solving, communication, adaptation, teamwork and entrepreneurship. ** Download the press release Some pictures from the online event. 1 photo_2021-09-07_16-30-58 photo_2021-09-07_16-31-02 Screenshot 2021-09-07 102901 Related Events<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":11774,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"elementor_header_footer","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[179],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-11748","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-news"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/11748","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/w